    "text": "$1^{\\circ}$ amines (aliphatic and aromatic) react with $\\mathrm{CHCl}_3 / \\mathrm{KOH}$ to yield isocyanide (foul smelling) This is known as carbylamine test which is not given by $2^{\\circ}$ and $3^{\\circ}$ amines."
